der the stated absence of an owner-aware object change grant. No decisive runtime fact is missing within the declared boundary because the task supplies the relevant premises and the fixed source shows the controlling branch. This is not a repository-wide or deployment-completeness claim; source discovery is not-tested.","facts":[{"id":"f-entry","kind":"entry","statement":"The declared notes endpoint is a detail action accepting POST and using PaperlessNotePermissions.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-dbf91e921bfbd270","startLine":1841,"endLine":1848}]},{"id":"f-identity-binding","kind":"binding","statement":"The handler binds the authenticated request user to currentUser and passes that identity into the authorization checks and eventual note creation.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-dbf91e921bfbd270","startLine":1848,"endLine":1849}]},{"id":"f-resource-binding","kind":"binding","statement":"The target document is loaded from the request pk, including its owner relation, and a missing document produces Http404.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-dbf91e921bfbd270","startLine":1850,"endLine":1864}]},{"id":"f-global-control","kind":"control","statement":"PaperlessNotePermissions requires the three listed global permissions for POST and evaluates them through request-user has_perms.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-81f6400744c9c9e9","startLine":673,"endLine":699}]},{"id":"f-view-control","kind":"control","statement":"Before method dispatch, the handler applies an owner-aware view_document check and forbids access when it fails.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-dbf91e921bfbd270","startLine":1857,"endLine":1862}]},{"id":"f-change-control","kind":"control","statement":"In the POST branch, the handler applies an owner-aware change_document check and returns HttpResponseForbidden when it fails.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-dbf91e921bfbd270","startLine":1877,"endLine":1886}]},{"id":"f-owner-aware-semantics","kind":"condition","statement":"The supplied owner-aware permission helper allows an owner or an unowned object, otherwise requiring the requested object permission.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-81f6400744c9c9e9","startLine":624,"endLine":635}]},{"id":"f-effect","kind":"effect","statement":"Note.objects.create is the protected note-creation effect and is reached only after the POST change_document check.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-dbf91e921bfbd270","startLine":1877,"endLine":1892}]}],"decisiveMissingFacts":[],"suggestedObservations":[]}]}}],"tokens":{"input":10433,"output":1005,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0},"costUsd":null,"durationMs":45237.3162,"stopReason":"tool_use"},"schemaValidation":{"valid":true,"diagnostics":[]},"endedAt":"2026-09-27T19:27:42.524Z"}}
